# Secret - file nay THANG config.json cho rieng key duoi day.
#
# Muc dich: giu API key khoi %APPDATA%\AutoVoiceTikTokShop\config.json
# (file do GUI ghi, ban co the mo de xem).
#
# Cac key KHONG phai secret (LLM_BASE_URL, LLM_MODEL, ...) cua ban dat trong
# config.json qua GUI - neu dat o day se bi config.json che, va moi lan
# bam "Luu cau hinh" trong GUI se khong co hieu luc.
#
# Ten bien viet HOA, gia tri theo ten key trong config.json.
LLM_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
